                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "To me it looks like there is only one existing config\n\n```\n rg Item.Dimm configurations/\nconfigurations/meta/yv4/yosemite4_wailuafalls.json\n300:    \"xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Item.Dimm\": {}\n```\nso it could be possible to figure out the property values there and fill it out, then mark the properties here as required.\n\nBut i guess the patch is already improving things as-is without these changes."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 19,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the review. Updated the commit message to remove the\n\"optional\" wording.\n\nRegarding marking properties as required: DIMMs are field-replaceable,\nso the actual attributes can change across units sharing the same\nconfig. Prefer to keep the current form for now."
                }
            ],
